WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:05.151
Last summer, I took my first surf lesson. Let me tell you!

2
00:00:06.601 --> 00:00:10.502
In the first hour, I wasn't able to stand on the board.

3
00:00:10.952 --> 00:00:13.135
I fell again and again!

4
00:00:15.385 --> 00:00:20.958
But after two hours, I was able to stand up for five seconds!

5
00:00:23.208 --> 00:00:26.551
I was so happy! I was able to do it!

6
00:00:28.801 --> 00:00:33.538
Next summer, I'll be able to surf bigger waves… I hope!

7
00:00:35.788 --> 00:00:39.364
And you? What were you able to learn last year?

